    {
      "text": "Dissolution of iodine in water.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissociation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CaO</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></math>.",
