  "solution": {
    "text": "If a process leads to the arrangement in a system, it will have a negative entropy, whereas if disorder increases, the entropy will be positive. When the number of moles of a gas increases, or ice melts, the disorder increases. Freezing of water, crystallization, combination reactions etc, leads to an arrangement.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>CaO</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Dissolution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>I</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#916;S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>."
  }
